 "summary": "Nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the surface-mount SMA (DO-214AC) package, all rated for 2.0 A average forward current and a 50 A surge. The types differ in reverse voltage, from 20 V (SS22) to 200 V (SS220); the SS24 blocks 40 V. Maximum forward drop at 2 A climbs with the voltage rating, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V. Uses named are fast switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping.",
